<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-INSIGHT-BHP oversold, retracement seen soon.</title>
<headline>RTRS-INSIGHT-BHP oversold, retracement seen soon.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>---------------The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd-------------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res15.90 16.40 16.70*RSI-14 29.50 *MA-10 16.87</p>
<p>15.20 - 15.85 *Sup15.50 14.75 14.55*MA-20 17.16 *MA-40 16.99</p>
<p>---------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - Sept 13------------</p>
<p>*All indicators moving lower and oversold</p>
<p>*Over extended selling could attract fresh buyers</p>
<p>*Current levels must hold, for bulls to enter market</p>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd's (BHP) share price has been falling for the past 4 months, and could be at levels to tempt fresh buyers.</p>
